1
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,510
Wh-Who are you people?

2
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,210
Well, Miss Mitsugoshi lady...

3
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:15,010
Your company's just making 
way too much money.

4
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:17,160
Tea leaves, cacao, coffee...

5
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:20,380
A hundred million zeni would be 
chump change for this cart alone.

6
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:24,850
Your business has been growing like crazy, 
and my boss thinks it's time to put a stop to it!

7
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:30,720
Y-Your boss?

8
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,850
Ever heard of Garter?

9
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:37,700
He controls all the buying and selling in Midgar, 
and you ladies went and made him mad.

10
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,130
Oh, no...

11
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:41,700
Mr. Garter?

12
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:46,090
But everyone knows he's a respectable gentleman who serves 
as the president of the Major Corporate Alliance.

13
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:50,440
He's a faithful follower of the Divine Teachings 
who's made many sizable donations to the Church!

14
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:56,200
He's certainly not the type to hire a bunch of ruffians like you 
to interfere with honest businesspeople!

15
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:59,660
Then I guess you 
learned something, didn't you?

16
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:02,700
Even the most righteous 
have a dark side they hide.

17
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,340
Garter only made it as big as he did 
by making the most of people like us.

18
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:08,880
I don't believe...

19
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:12,840
that it makes much difference 
by telling us what we already know.

20
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:13,800
Huh?

21
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,350
I will admit that there is value 
in testimony from an involved party.

22
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:25,230
Every person alive 
has a dark side they hide.

23
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:27,590
Either righteous or wicked...

24
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:29,900
Exceptional or ordinary...

25
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:32,190
Even man or woman...

26
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:35,000
Women, all wearing black?

27
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,340
No, you can't be...

28
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:39,090
Unsheathe the sword of judgment.

29
00:01:48,310 --> 00:01:51,800
It's true, the night is best 
when it's quiet.

30
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:57,130
I believe we have reduced their legitimate ranks 
considerably with this operation.

31
00:01:57,130 --> 00:01:58,490
So, now...

32
00:01:58,490 --> 00:02:03,650
Yes, the underworld players connected 
to the Cult should start to show themselves.

33
00:02:05,290 --> 00:02:06,600
The war...

34
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,000
is about to begin.

